# nexora-action-code: get_temperature
Value Filldown CPU_TEMP (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value Filldown MAINBOARD_TEMP (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value List FAN_ID (\d+)
Value List FAN_STATUS (\w+)

Start
  ^.*#\s*show\s+ -> Next
  ^---environment\s+information--- -> Next
  ^CPU\s+Temperature:\s*${CPU_TEMP}(?:\.|\s*C)?\s*$$
  ^Mainboard\s+Temperature:\s*${MAINBOARD_TEMP}(?:\.|\s*C)?\s*$$
  ^FAN\s+${FAN_ID}\s+is\s+${FAN_STATUS}!?\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
